# Keep the build context small and free of host-only artifacts.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/generated/prisma
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# `web` stays in the context — it's a pnpm-workspace member, so `pnpm install
# --frozen-lockfile` needs its package.json. Its build output is excluded above.
.git
.github
docs
test
mobile

# Flutter / Dart
**/.dart_tool
**/build
**/.flutter-plugins*

# local env + editor
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store

# scratch
**/coverage
**/.turbo
